</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;방학 중 리더십 교육과정을 이수한 학생들의 감동을 그대로 전해</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">드리기 위해 “2012 하계 리더십 교육캠프 참가후기 공모전”을 아래와 같이 진행하오니, 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 참가대상 : 하계방학 리더십 교육캠프 참가자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 응모 및 접수 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼엑스포'\">◇ </span></span>접수기간: ‘12. 9. 3.(월) ~ 9.13.(목)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼엑스포'\">◇ </span>접수방법: 파일작성 후 이메일 sinsia@kumoh.ac.kr으로 접수</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼엑스포'\">◇ </span>응모서류: 리더십 교육캠프 참가후기 1부(첨부양식 참조)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼엑스포'\">◇ </span>형식</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 한글파일, 글자크기 11pt, A4 2장이상</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 일기, 소감문 등 형식의 제한은 없으나 참여동기, 교육기간 중 소감, 교육이수 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 전.후의 모습, 각오 및 기대를 포함하여 작성하며 사진 등 첨부가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 우수 공모작 시상</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"center\" width=\"91\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"68\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">구분</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(인원)</span></p></