IZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼엑스포'\">◇ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">수상기준에 부합하는 응모작이 없을 경우 수상 내역은 조정될 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼엑스포'\">◇ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">시</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">상 이후 기 공개된 내용 또는 표절사실이 밝혀질 경우 시상을&nbsp; 취소하고 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">상품을 환수함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼엑스포'\">◇ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">기타 문의사항은 기획협력처 기획평가팀(478-7076)으로 문의</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
